### Payments — Homebase API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@invoiceId = 01a0aeb5-1050-754a-b4c6-fc6ecbdb0a38
@paymentId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49fa
@reference = HB-EXAMPLE-REF

### 1. Initiate M-Pesa STK Push (tenant receives prompt on phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/mpesa/stk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "phoneNumber": "0727125059"
}

### 2. Initiate Card Payment (returns authorizationUrl — redirect tenant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/card
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}"
}

### 3. Optional: Card payment with custom callback (where tenant lands after checkout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/card
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "callbackUrl": "http://localhost:5173/payments/result"
}

### 4. Register C2B URLs with Safaricom (one-time setup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/c2b/register-urls

### 5. Verify Payment by Reference (poll fallback when webhooks can't reach you)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/verify/{{reference}}

### 6. List Payments (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?page=1&limit=10

### 7. List Payments for an Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?invoiceId={{invoiceId}}

### 8. Filter Payments by Method / Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?method=MPESA_STK&status=SUCCESS

### 9. Get Payment Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}

### ── Webhooks (normally hit by providers, not you) ──────────

### Daraja STK result callback
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/stk-callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Body": {
    "stkCallback": {
      "MerchantRequestID": "29115-34620561-1",
      "CheckoutRequestID": "ws_CO_191220191020363925",
      "ResultCode": 0,
      "ResultDesc": "The service request is processed successfully.",
      "CallbackMetadata": {
        "Item": [
          { "Name": "Amount", "Value": 1.00 },
          { "Name": "MpesaReceiptNumber", "Value": "NLJ7RT61SV" },
          { "Name": "Balance" },
          { "Name": "TransactionDate", "Value": 20191219102115 },
          { "Name": "PhoneNumber", "Value": 254708374149 }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}

### Daraja C2B confirmation (tenant paid paybill; BillRefNumber = invoice id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/c2b-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TransactionType": "Pay Bill",
  "TransID": "TEST001",
  "TransTime": "20260916101010",
  "TransAmount": "15000.00",
  "BusinessShortCode": "600000",
  "BillRefNumber": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "InvoiceNumber": "",
  "OrgAccountBalance": "1000.00",
  "ThirdPartyTransID": "",
  "MSISDN": "254708374149",
  "FirstName": "John",
  "MiddleName": "",
  "LastName": "Doe"
}

### Paystack charge.success webhook
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook/paystack
Content-Type: application/json
x-paystack-signature: <hmac-sha512-of-raw-body>

{
  "event": "charge.success",
  "data": {
    "reference": "{{reference}}",
    "status": "success",
    "amount": 1500000,
    "currency": "KES"
  }
}